                                "example_id": "3ae1fbf7-a4a2-4c70-a250-8449f50e0815",
                                "sense_id": "add88203-704d-31c9-8a48-821dd6b9f515",
                                "text": "And finally, as an overgird to the whole piece, we need to establish policies that are clear to each employee in the Department of Energy and contractors that indicate, first of all, that program implementation and development happens through the Federal arm and not through contractor hand and mind."
